{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈金行ってきます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は観覧ないよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/02/1622479/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツイキャスもないから\nラジオとかradikoプレミアムで聴いてね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、沈金へ移動中です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間に合うかな？\n間に合うといいなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうなんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきまで\nセブン-イレブン限定ミニライブイベント\nでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/02/1622479/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Overture\nきっかけ\n命は美しい\nポピパッパパー\n不等号○\n嫉妬の権利○\n今、話したい誰かがいる\n-MC-\n太陽に口説かれて\n別れ際、もっと好きになる○\n君は僕と会わない方がよかったのかな○\n羽根の記憶\n-MC-\n太陽ノック\n悲しみの忘れ方○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"[encore]\n裸足でSummer\n-MC-\n制服のマネキン\nおいでシャンプー ○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほぼオリメンでやりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンコールだけは\n15th選抜ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアーは会場が広いこともあって\nいろんな演出がついてるけど\n今回は久々に\n元々の振付を披露するライブでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうライブの時しかできないし\nやっぱりオリジナルをやるのもいいなーって\n思った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/02/1622479/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいシャンでは\n15thアンダーは間奏から出たけど\nちょうど出るタイミングでコールあったから\nドキッとしてしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/02/1622479/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たったみなさんおめぺろ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさんありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡でやった乃木恋の時の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/02/1622479/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/02/1622479/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガネ有りver.は撮ってなかった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}